<h2>Asobi 1.0 (build 965)</h2>
<ul>
<li><b>Mute silences voice notes too.</b> M (or the sound button) now mutes a playing voice note, and a note started while muted plays silently; the playhead still follows it. Same on the web page.</li>
<li>On the web: the picture &#8212; playing or parked &#8212; is drawn through one path, so its gamma no longer shifts between the two, in Safari as well as Chrome; the guide wears the manual's design; <i>Asobi &#215; Autonomy</i> in the header.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
